nul
# Corpus text and model weights. Both are large and both are reproducible —
# the corpora from the download manifest beside them, the checkpoints because
# training on this stack reproduces bitwise from a seed. What is NOT
# reproducible is the record of what produced them, so the manifests, the
# vocabularies and the RunRecord sidecars stay tracked and sit in the same
# directories.
#
# Patterns rather than per-generation paths, deliberately. This block used to
# name four exact directories, so every new generation needed a new line and
# nobody added one — v3, v5 and v6 were all untracked in full, manifests
# included, which is the state this replaces.
rebuild_*/**/*.txt
corpora_pilot_*/*.txt
corpora_variant_b/*.txt
data/perception_pilot_*/*.txt
data/perception_variant_b/*.txt
checkpoints_*/*.pt
checkpoints_*/*.pt.resume

# Build output
dist/
